# DevMinds platform environment templates
#
# Use one of these tracked templates (deploy scripts copy it to active .env):
#
#   Localhost (IP + ports, no Nginx):
#     .env.local  →  .\scripts\deploy.ps1
#                 →  ./scripts/deploy.sh
#                 →  compose: docker-compose.yml + docker-compose.local.yml
#
#   Production (domains + Nginx):
#     .env.production  →  .\scripts\deploy.ps1 -Env production
#                      →  ./scripts/deploy.sh production
#                      →  compose: docker-compose.yml only
#
# Active runtime file is always ".env" (gitignored).
#
# Full guides: docs/LOCALHOST.md  |  docs/DEPLOY-VPS.md
